      "rule": "R5",
      "severity": "should",
      "text": "`Syntax.Expr.sourceAffinity` ends with a catch-all `| _ => none` over `Syntax.Expr`, whose constructors mean different things. A new constructor would then get no affinity without a compile error. Fix: list the remaining constructors explicitly, as `Syntax.Expr.columnCollation` does."
