      "rule": "R5",
      "severity": "should",
      "text": "`Syntax.Expr.sourceTypes` ends with a catch-all `| _ => (true, false)`. A new constructor would silently count as numeric-only, which feeds the compound affinity decision. Fix: list each remaining constructor explicitly."
    }
